# Force LF line endings for all tracked text so checkouts are byte-identical
# across platforms. Without this, Windows git checkouts (core.autocrlf=true,
# the default on GitHub's windows-latest runner) rewrite LF to CRLF, which
# breaks exact-string checks against course content (e.g. lesson markdown
# expected to start with "# Title\n") and would corrupt LearnPack hashing.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.learnpack binary
